      "Note: the working tree contains uncommitted WIP (inline chat input + fcitx IME env setup); review the CURRENT working-tree state. Pay attention to: blocking network calls on the Qt main thread, timer leaks, race conditions on history, error paths that crash the daemon, silent failures.`\n",
