      "2. Reject false positives (claim not true in current code), already-mis-scoped claims, and duplicates. List their ids in rejected_ids.\n",
      "3. For accepted findings, emit ONE final ledger entry each: keep the ORIGINAL id, correct the severity if the evidence demands it, merge exact duplicates (keep the primary id and note merged ids in the notes field), refine description/suggested_fix if you found something more precise.\n",
      "4. Do NOT invent new findings here (a separate coverage pass does that).\n",
      "5. Do NOT modify any files.\n",
      "\n",
      "FINDINGS JSON:\n",
      "${JSON.stringify(findings)}`;\n",
      "\n",
      "const coveragePrompt = (findings) => `You are the FRESH-EYES COVERAGE pass of a clustered code review for /home/pika/work/bingoagent (Minecraft Bingo agent: PyQt5 daemon src/mc_bingo_agent/app.py, Java JVM hook java_hook/, systemd unit, packaging).\n",
      "\n",
      "Below is a list of TITLES of findings already reported by earlier review layers:\n",
      "${findings.map((f) => '- ' + f.id + ' [' + f.severity + '] ' + f.title + ' (' + f.file + ')').join('\\n')}\n",
