      "Your job: read the project files yourself (app.py fully, java_hook/src/mc/bingo/hook/BingoHookAgentV4.java and AttachTool.java, systemd/mc-bingo-agent.service, pyproject.toml) and find IMPORTANT issues that all earlier reviewers MISSED — bugs, risks, and high-value improvements not covered by any title above. Do NOT re-report anything already listed. Report at most 10 genuinely new findings, most important first, with the same schema: severity, category, file, location, title, description, evidence (exact quote), suggested_fix. If nothing important is missing, report an empty findings array. Do NOT modify any files.`;\n",
      "\n",
      "phase('文件级审查');\n",
      "const phase1 = await parallel(\n",
      "  fileReviewers.map((r) => () => agent(r.prompt, { schema: FINDING_SCHEMA, label: r.label, phase: '文件级审查' }))\n",
